OL,3,AKenya confirms its first Ebola death as
OL,4,Aoutbreak spreads
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 4,000 people have died from
OL,7,FEbola in DR Congo this year, in what is
OL,8,Fthe second most deadly known outbreak
OL,9,Fof the disease.
